"ai_prompt_section_highlights_desc" = "(Select the 2 most important highlights of the game. Find personal scoring runs or clutch plays from Scoring Run Analysis. For each highlight, clearly state the score at the time, who made the play, and how it changed the game. Conversational tone, not formal)
Format:
1. Title
   Description
2. Title
   Description";
